WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.387
Eddy was at the racetrack.

2
00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:17.958
Roar! Eddy took off!

3
00:00:17.959 --> 00:00:20.469
There was a bend in the track.

4
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.550
Eddy didn't slow down.

5
00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:25.055
He shot around the bend.

6
00:00:25.056 --> 00:00:28.573
But then he slid.

7
00:00:28.574 --> 00:00:31.540
"Whoa!" cried Eddy.

8
00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:37.048
"I almost crashed!"

9
00:00:37.049 --> 00:00:39.463
There was another bend.

10
00:00:39.464 --> 00:00:43.749
"I'll slow down this time," he thought.

11
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.509
Eddy hit his brakes.

12
00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:53.834
But they didn't work. Crash!

13
00:00:53.835 --> 00:01:00.258
"Ouch!"

14
00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:06.151
cried Eddy. Eddy

15
00:01:06.152 --> 00:01:22.052
rolled slowly to the garage. Mr.

16
00:01:22.053 --> 00:01:28.250
Grill fixed his brakes. Later

17
00:01:28.251 --> 00:01:33.692
Eddy was in the parking lot. "Let's

18
00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:39.279
play tag!" said Poppy. Eddy

19
00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.212
roared his engine .

20
00:01:42.213 --> 00:01:47.134
He started to drive.

21
00:01:47.135 --> 00:01:51.966
But then he remembered the crash.

22
00:01:51.967 --> 00:02:00.069
Eddy stopped.

23
00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:05.125
"I'm scared to go fast!"

